    {
      "title": "一杯咖啡的时间",
      "words": [
        "gentle",
        "curious",
        "delight"
      ],
      "model": "Model B",
      "style": "Story",
      "length": "Brief",
      "language": "English",
      "sampleText": "A gentle breeze slipped through the open window of a small café. Emma sat beside it with a cup of coffee and a book she had almost finished. At the next table, a stranger was drawing a map on a paper napkin. Curious about the tiny houses and winding streets, she asked what he was making.\n\nIt was a map of the neighborhood as he remembered it from childhood. He pointed to a bakery that had become a flower shop and a garden hidden behind the station. To Emma’s delight, the garden was still there. She had walked past its gate many times without noticing it.\n\nWhen her coffee was gone, Emma thanked him and took the longer route home. Behind the station, she found a bench beneath a lemon tree. A simple question had turned an ordinary morning into a small adventure.",
