  "notices": [
    {
      "title": {
        "zh": "让复习成为完整的一段时光",
        "en": "Make room for a complete review"
      },
      "body": {
        "zh": "每一篇短文，都是一次把词语串联起来的机会。选一些想学的词，给自己留一段专注阅读的时间。\n\n## 一篇短文，几种学习方式\n\n- **先读完整短文**，感受词语在句子中的位置。\n- 再看词语释义与提示短语，逐个理解。\n- 收录到书架，想复习时再回来。\n\n> 不急着记住所有细节。今天读懂一点，下一次再向前一点。\n\n## 复习可以慢慢来\n\n1. 填写你记得的拼写，暂时想不起的可以跳过。\n2. 在结果概览里回看，也可以返回修改。\n3. 提交后，对照答案，看看哪些词还需要再练一次。\n\n### 把容易混淆的地方记清楚\n\n| 复习时 | 可以怎么做 |\n| --- | --- |\n| 拼写只记得一部分 | 先填上记得的字母 |\n| 想重新检查 | 从概览返回对应步骤 |\n| 本次仍有错误 | 看完总结后，再来一遍 |\n\n释义语言可以选择 **中文、英文或日文**。例如，`resilient` 对应一个原始词条；正文中见到不同词形时，也别忘了它们之间的联系。\n\n---\n\n**一点点进步，也值得被记住。**\n",
        "en": "Every passage is a chance to connect words. Choose a few you want to learn and give yourself a little time to read.\n\n## One passage, a few ways to learn\n\n- **Read the whole passage** to see how the words fit together.\n- Explore word meanings and hint phrases.\n- Save it to your bookshelf and return when you want to review.\n\n> You do not have to remember everything at once. Understand a little today, and take another step next time.\n\n## Review at your own pace\n\n1. Enter the spelling you remember, or skip a word for now.\n2. Check the overview and revisit any answer.\n3. Submit to compare your answers and see what to practise again.\n\n### Make room for another try\n\n| During review | What you can do |\n| --- | --- |\n| You remember part of a word | Enter the letters you know |\n| You want to check an answer | Return from the overview |\n| Some answers need work | Read the summary and try again |\n\nChoose word meanings in **Chinese, English or Japanese**. For example, `resilient` is one original word; when its forms change in a passage, look for the connection.\n\n---\n\n**Every small step counts.**\n"
      },
